# Intentionally has no pnpm-only settings.
#
# `node-linker=hoisted` used to live here, but npm reads every .npmrc and warns
# about keys it does not recognise ("Unknown project config: node-linker"), which
# printed a warning on every `npm run` and `npx` invocation. pnpm 10 reads that
# setting from pnpm-workspace.yaml as `nodeLinker: hoisted`, where npm never looks.
#
# Keep this file for genuine npm configuration (registry, auth) only.
